  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1905.04 Signed Notices. Notices signed by a majority of the assessing officials shall include abatements:\n\n(a) Granted to the taxpayer; or\n\n(b) Of one tax applied to another overdue tax owed by the taxpayer.\n\nSource. #5356, eff 3-16-92, EXPIRED: 3-16-98\n\nNew. #6732, eff 4-18-98; ss by #8599, eff 4-6-06; ss by #10582, eff 5-2-14; ss by #13918, eff 3-29-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1900)",
